Subject: [PATCH 180/207] Register the sharded proof host

tools/runner-proof-shards.patch applied as is: test-runner-proof-host keeps its
module and runner proof: filter and now runs each test in its own process;
test-runner-proof-list prints the catalog. Zig's MIT license ships with the
adapted test runner.
